  "description": "Built for riders who spend more time in the saddle and ask more from their bike.\nThe Shimano EP801 drive system delivers powerful, responsive assistance that feels just as comfortable hauling heavy loads through the city as it does tackling longer distances and varied terrain. With plenty of torque on tap and quick response from the motor, it keeps pace with demanding days and changing conditions.\nCombined with the Bullitt's low weight and direct handling, the result is a cargo bike that feels responsive even when fully loaded. The extra power is there when you need it, without overwhelming the ride.\nAvailable with both internal and external gearing options, it's a setup well suited to professional use, high mileage and riders who depend on their bike day in, day out.",
